VA resistor on VACASK, parameter lower-cased (r), instance-typed on the per-instance card
load "toy_resistor.va"
model vamos_vsource vsource
model r1__va resistor r=3k
model r2__va resistor r=1k
v1 (a 0) vamos_vsource dc=1
r1 (a b) r1__va
r2 (b 0) r2__va
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
endc
